WEBVTT

01:40.820 --> 01:45.650
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.410 --> 01:50.840
[Episode 22]

01:51.360 --> 01:54.910
[Drunken Dream Tower]

01:59.910 --> 02:00.390
Stop!

02:01.280 --> 02:02.060
Stop there!

02:02.470 --> 02:03.330
Stop!

02:04.760 --> 02:05.400
Stop!

02:15.400 --> 02:16.530
Why are you running?

02:16.770 --> 02:18.150
Please, let me go.

02:18.180 --> 02:19.360
Don't let me go into the illusion.

02:19.360 --> 02:20.030
I saw it.

02:20.190 --> 02:22.970
Everyone who went
into the illusion died horribly.

02:22.970 --> 02:24.190
Please, let me go!

02:24.210 --> 02:25.310
Don't let me go into the illusion!

02:25.310 --> 02:25.800
Please.

02:25.840 --> 02:27.100
That's not up to you.

02:28.280 --> 02:29.040
No!

02:29.120 --> 02:30.450
Please, let me go!

02:30.470 --> 02:31.780
I'm not going into the illusion!

02:31.780 --> 02:33.210
No!

02:44.560 --> 02:45.530
Quzhuo.

02:45.920 --> 02:48.820
Tonight is my first night
after becoming a demon.

02:49.270 --> 02:51.870
It's also
when my demonic nature is at its peak.

02:52.360 --> 02:54.900
By all logic,
I shouldn't be able to control myself.

02:54.900 --> 02:56.560
You must keep a close eye on me.

02:56.960 --> 02:57.690
Hongye,

02:58.380 --> 02:59.120
no problem.

03:17.410 --> 03:19.030
The eternal night befalls.

03:19.280 --> 03:20.840
Fate cannot be changed.

03:21.480 --> 03:23.210
Dongfang Huaizhu.

03:23.710 --> 03:25.150
You can't escape.

04:23.390 --> 04:24.990
He's all covered with frost.

04:26.000 --> 04:29.060
Is he suffering from
the snake demon's demonic nature?

04:35.340 --> 04:37.310
♪ How can the wind stop? ♪

04:37.970 --> 04:40.310
♪ How can clouds stop for us? ♪

04:41.100 --> 04:44.650
♪ The vicissitudes of life never cease ♪

04:45.610 --> 04:50.290
♪ The time we spend together is too short and unreal ♪

04:51.240 --> 04:55.260
♪ You blur into a shadow near me ♪

04:56.350 --> 04:58.350
♪ We're fully committed ♪

04:58.600 --> 04:59.560
I didn't expect

04:58.890 --> 05:00.690
♪ We're wholly devoted ♪

05:00.240 --> 05:01.830
the Dongfang Spiritual Blood in me

05:01.710 --> 05:05.600
♪ Love has us spellbound ♪

05:02.950 --> 05:04.410
to have this kind of power.

05:06.060 --> 05:08.380
♪ We're lost in a wasteland ♪

05:09.000 --> 05:11.230
♪ A lonely boat lies around ♪

05:12.270 --> 05:16.360
♪ To the moon I tell how much I miss you ♪

05:18.560 --> 05:23.000
♪ My passion for you never fades ♪

05:23.640 --> 05:26.200
♪ It's a guardian angel ♪

05:26.660 --> 05:28.620
♪ Hovering high in the sky ♪

05:29.390 --> 05:31.220
♪ Time goes by ♪

05:31.890 --> 05:33.780
♪ Stars twinkle and dim ♪

05:34.610 --> 05:37.990
♪ But our love remains still ♪

05:39.570 --> 05:43.950
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

05:44.850 --> 05:47.240
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

05:48.120 --> 05:50.020
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

05:50.550 --> 05:52.190
♪ But everywhere I see ♪

05:52.960 --> 05:54.700
♪ Your image sticks around ♪

05:55.400 --> 05:58.990
♪ Holding your hands, I can't speak a word ♪

06:21.960 --> 06:25.880
♪ I'll give away my everything ♪

06:26.930 --> 06:29.630
♪ In exchange for a life of joy for you ♪

06:28.310 --> 06:30.270
Why am I in Huaizhu's room?

06:30.040 --> 06:32.159
♪ There can be many new chapters in my life ♪

06:32.550 --> 06:34.470
♪ The past vanishes ♪

06:33.310 --> 06:34.960
Demonic nature is hard to tame.

06:34.960 --> 06:37.010
♪ Like a dream and a whiff of smoke ♪

06:35.800 --> 06:37.530
It's already causing trouble.

06:37.640 --> 06:41.210
♪ I hope to see you again in the next life, if there is one ♪

07:13.480 --> 07:14.490
What's wrong?

07:15.480 --> 07:16.520
Is there a fire?

07:17.000 --> 07:19.240
My Lady, it's time to get up.

07:19.390 --> 07:20.510
As you instructed,

07:20.630 --> 07:22.940
I must wake you up at 6:45 AM.

07:23.410 --> 07:24.810
Let me sleep a bit longer.

07:25.120 --> 07:26.430
Wake me up after 30 minutes.

07:26.430 --> 07:28.270
My Lady, if you can't get up,

07:28.360 --> 07:29.680
you can go tomorrow.

07:29.800 --> 07:31.310
Anyway, the intel says

07:31.430 --> 07:33.790
Master Zhang Zheng goes to

07:33.870 --> 07:36.870
Zhang's wonton shop
for wontons every day at 8 AM.

07:40.610 --> 07:43.090
I'm getting up. Help me change.

07:47.750 --> 07:49.210
Young Master Wangquan.

07:53.680 --> 07:56.340
Why were you sneaking around in Huaizhu's room?

07:58.770 --> 08:00.200
It's not what you think.

08:00.430 --> 08:01.630
Not what I think?

08:01.630 --> 08:02.630
Then what is it?

08:04.160 --> 08:06.680
So in your eyes, I'm that kind of person.

08:07.040 --> 08:09.040
Cut the crap and start talking.

08:11.160 --> 08:14.120
I indeed spent last night
in your sister's room.

08:17.360 --> 08:20.070
It was because
my demonic aura suddenly flared up.

08:20.070 --> 08:21.800
I felt so cold and lost control.

08:21.800 --> 08:23.190
Huaizhu has a special constitution.

08:23.190 --> 08:25.450
I couldn't stop myself from going to her.

08:26.270 --> 08:29.390
But I swear,
I didn't do anything inappropriate.

08:31.390 --> 08:32.990
You don't have to believe me,

08:33.289 --> 08:36.419
but don't you trust your own sister?

08:42.600 --> 08:43.720
I'm warning you—

08:43.870 --> 08:45.510
stay away from Huaizhu.

08:45.870 --> 08:47.870
She's way out of your league.

08:48.460 --> 08:49.630
Hold your brother.

09:00.870 --> 09:02.600
Miss Qingmu told me to bring you

09:02.600 --> 09:04.360
some information
about the Drunken Dream Tower.

09:04.360 --> 09:05.630
Here.

09:07.430 --> 09:08.160
Thank you.

09:12.120 --> 09:12.910
Huaizhu,

09:13.630 --> 09:16.150
why are you so nice
to Young Master Wangquan?

09:17.120 --> 09:19.910
Last night,
he was affected by the demonic nature.

09:19.910 --> 09:21.870
He didn't cross any lines.

09:22.550 --> 09:24.510
Why didn't he go to Li Quzhuo?

09:24.670 --> 09:26.800
Wouldn't holding a mongrel be warmer?

09:28.080 --> 09:30.000
He clearly came to you on purpose.

09:31.320 --> 09:32.790
You have a point.

09:32.810 --> 09:34.790
See? I told you.

09:34.910 --> 09:37.570
You never really know
what's in someone's mind.

09:39.480 --> 09:43.150
Huaizhu, you can't trust him so easily.

09:43.200 --> 09:44.000
We can't

09:44.000 --> 09:45.750
be fooled by his sweet talk.

09:46.030 --> 09:46.790
Huaizhu.

09:50.200 --> 09:51.600
How dare you come again!

09:56.670 --> 09:58.330
Yuan sent us new information.

09:58.840 --> 09:59.600
Qinlan,

10:00.030 --> 10:01.670
we have important matters to discuss.

10:01.670 --> 10:03.910
Why don't you go get some sun?

10:04.670 --> 10:06.930
Close the door on your way out. Thank you.

10:22.600 --> 10:24.430
Wangquan Hongye,

10:24.630 --> 10:27.090
there's no way
I'm letting you have your way.

10:29.250 --> 10:30.910
Yuan said the Drunken Dream Tower

10:30.910 --> 10:33.170
is spending huge sums on the black market

10:33.440 --> 10:34.790
to buy powerful demons.

10:34.910 --> 10:36.840
When does the black market open?

10:36.840 --> 10:38.640
Yuan is already investigating.

10:42.210 --> 10:44.760
[Zhang's Wontons]

10:51.870 --> 10:53.130
Here are your wontons.

10:54.120 --> 10:54.870
Thank you.

10:54.960 --> 10:55.790
Enjoy.

10:59.270 --> 11:00.870
Sir, one bowl of wontons, please.

11:00.870 --> 11:01.530
Certainly.

11:01.550 --> 11:02.450
I want pork wontons.

11:02.450 --> 11:03.780
Alright, this way, sir.

11:19.100 --> 11:20.960
Didn't you just say you were hungry?

11:20.960 --> 11:22.680
Miss, take a look at this.

11:22.800 --> 11:23.900
Let's get going.

11:24.080 --> 11:25.330
Come, take a look.

11:25.390 --> 11:26.520
Sturdy and durable.

11:41.070 --> 11:42.900
Qingmu Yuan, you fool,

11:43.320 --> 11:45.780
why do you have to
put yourself through this?

11:53.440 --> 11:54.890
He hasn't come anyway.

11:56.150 --> 11:57.440
I'll take a nap first.

12:13.760 --> 12:14.490
What is it?

12:19.780 --> 12:21.280
It's the last one. Take it.

12:24.720 --> 12:26.320
Eat it while it's hot and tasty.

12:26.320 --> 12:27.450
It'll get cold soon.

12:27.540 --> 12:28.780
It's the last one?

12:28.870 --> 12:30.440
Why aren't you eating it?

12:31.390 --> 12:32.520
If it's the last one,

12:32.670 --> 12:34.030
and I fight a girl for it,

12:34.390 --> 12:35.850
my mom would break my legs.

12:37.720 --> 12:38.630
Good upbringing.

12:38.630 --> 12:39.360
Same as mine.

12:42.670 --> 12:44.000
Can I ask you something?

12:44.840 --> 12:47.240
Why do you dislike Hongye so much?

12:52.840 --> 12:54.790
I don't exactly dislike him.

12:55.270 --> 12:56.270
It's just that...

12:56.270 --> 12:58.130
I already have a brother-in-law.

12:58.320 --> 13:00.390
He's the Mask Group Leader.

13:01.460 --> 13:03.240
So, for the sake of the masked sir,

13:03.240 --> 13:04.700
I need to protect Huaizhu.

13:05.110 --> 13:07.080
The… The Mask Group...

13:07.750 --> 13:09.150
Hong… Hongye…

13:09.320 --> 13:10.000
You...

13:10.990 --> 13:12.750
Is there something wrong with your eyes?

13:12.750 --> 13:14.680
Something's wrong with your eyes!

13:21.550 --> 13:22.680
Let me ask you again.

13:23.200 --> 13:27.000
What's so bad about Hongye

13:27.360 --> 13:28.960
compared to that masked guy?

13:33.120 --> 13:34.510
Young Master Wangquan

13:34.750 --> 13:36.270
is not a bad guy, actually.

13:36.840 --> 13:37.720
However,

13:38.200 --> 13:41.030
the Wangquan Manor
carries too much responsibility.

13:41.030 --> 13:44.390
Huaizhu is already exhausted
from managing the Divine Fire Villa.

13:44.390 --> 13:47.490
So only the carefree masked swordsman

13:47.550 --> 13:49.410
can give Huaizhu a carefree life.

13:50.430 --> 13:51.610
Your brain is messed up too.

13:51.610 --> 13:53.840
You're a total mess yourself!

13:54.440 --> 13:56.080
I care for Huaizhu.

13:56.200 --> 13:57.860
You don't get anything at all.

14:03.510 --> 14:04.320
Are you angry?

14:04.720 --> 14:06.270
I don't get angry with dogs.

14:07.960 --> 14:09.510
Don't be angry.

14:09.790 --> 14:10.840
I-I was just...

14:14.080 --> 14:15.680
Let me show you a magic trick.

14:19.120 --> 14:20.080
Go ahead.

14:33.630 --> 14:34.360
Take a guess.

14:36.440 --> 14:37.240
This hand.

14:42.840 --> 14:43.670
Meow meow.

14:48.870 --> 14:50.630
Try meowing one more time.

15:00.870 --> 15:03.270
What are your plans for today?

15:04.910 --> 15:08.030
I've arranged
a free clinic with the pharmacy owner.

15:10.000 --> 15:12.120
You need to gather more intel?

15:12.510 --> 15:13.270
Yes.

15:14.120 --> 15:16.120
What about you? What are your plans?

15:17.320 --> 15:18.790
During the day,
I'll keep working on my demonic techniques

15:18.790 --> 15:20.790
and see if I can unlock anything new.

15:21.270 --> 15:24.610
Then at dusk,
I'll pick you up from the pharmacy.

15:25.390 --> 15:28.630
Tonight, we'll go stargazing in the desert.

15:28.910 --> 15:29.840
But Qinlan…

15:29.870 --> 15:30.670
Don't worry.

15:31.030 --> 15:32.790
I'll ask Quzhuo to look after her.

15:32.790 --> 15:34.190
Who will look after whom?

15:42.000 --> 15:43.390
Huaizhu, I'm hungry.

15:43.550 --> 15:44.200
Qinlan.

15:45.060 --> 15:46.360
What did you just eat?

15:49.670 --> 15:51.670
I didn't eat enough. Is that a crime?

15:53.000 --> 15:53.710
Alright.

15:54.910 --> 15:55.550
Alright.

15:56.600 --> 15:58.360
Let's go get something to eat then.

15:58.360 --> 15:58.960
Let's go.

16:02.870 --> 16:05.100
How dare you covet Huaizhu?

16:05.240 --> 16:06.600
Stargazing?

16:07.000 --> 16:09.140
It's not going to happen!

16:09.320 --> 16:10.080
Qinlan.

16:11.840 --> 16:12.630
Coming!

16:22.670 --> 16:23.270
Sir.

16:23.910 --> 16:24.630
The usual.

16:24.630 --> 16:26.160
Got it. Asparagus wontons.

16:27.430 --> 16:28.540
Sir,

16:29.390 --> 16:29.920
this way.

17:25.829 --> 17:26.760
Is it delicious?

17:28.069 --> 17:28.750
Yes.

17:29.880 --> 17:32.010
Then I'll bring you more in the future.

17:44.010 --> 17:46.140
I get itchy every time I eat asparagus.

17:47.120 --> 17:48.380
I'm really useless.

17:54.880 --> 17:56.280
Sir, are you done eating?

18:04.110 --> 18:05.140
Take care, sir!

18:10.410 --> 18:11.300
Miss, wake up.

18:12.710 --> 18:13.510
Miss, wake up.

18:17.020 --> 18:18.750
The wontons are getting soggy.

18:19.580 --> 18:20.320
Okay.

18:23.490 --> 18:25.390
Boss, that guy is really strange.

18:25.450 --> 18:27.780
He only orders asparagus wontons every time.

18:27.780 --> 18:28.830
Just do your job.

18:29.590 --> 18:30.240
Waiter.

18:32.430 --> 18:34.310
The guy who only orders asparagus wontons—

18:34.310 --> 18:35.170
where did he go?

18:35.810 --> 18:36.740
He went that way.

18:55.430 --> 18:57.160
There should be more than that.

18:58.340 --> 19:00.540
There's clearly another demonic aura.

19:01.710 --> 19:02.270
Hongye.

19:03.650 --> 19:04.710
It's getting late.

19:04.960 --> 19:05.750
Put this on.

19:06.110 --> 19:06.970
It's time to go.

19:07.310 --> 19:08.000
Quzhuo.

19:08.850 --> 19:11.400
I think the one with tassels on the sleeves

19:11.510 --> 19:13.750
and jewels on the chest suits me better.

19:16.790 --> 19:18.270
Your opinion doesn't matter.

19:18.270 --> 19:20.920
On this matter, you listen to me.

19:26.110 --> 19:26.840
Miss Qinlan.

19:27.830 --> 19:29.360
Huaizhu asked me to tell you

19:29.400 --> 19:31.220
you don't need to meet her at the market.

19:31.220 --> 19:32.960
Just go to the place you two agreed on.

19:32.960 --> 19:34.220
She'll meet you there.

19:35.930 --> 19:37.110
She got up early

19:37.110 --> 19:38.840
and prepared this food for you.

19:41.180 --> 19:42.640
If you won't eat it, I will.

19:57.340 --> 19:58.670
Thank you, Miss Qinlan.

19:59.200 --> 20:00.240
You're welcome.

21:09.350 --> 21:10.920
It's been so many days.

21:11.510 --> 21:13.030
Why haven't I seen

21:13.030 --> 21:14.960
Wangquan Hongye's head yet?

21:21.160 --> 21:22.220
We've alerted him.

21:23.400 --> 21:25.440
He's hiding somewhere else now.

21:26.350 --> 21:28.010
I can't find him at the moment.

21:29.350 --> 21:30.920
Are you brushing me off?

21:31.750 --> 21:33.550
I'm doing this for your own good.

21:33.920 --> 21:37.980
Kill him, and you'll no longer
be the second-best swordsman in the world.

21:39.310 --> 21:41.070
I hope this is the last time.

21:44.880 --> 21:45.640
Son,

21:45.790 --> 21:49.000
do you remember your original name?

21:49.780 --> 21:51.360
Your name is Anaran.

21:51.640 --> 21:53.590
You are the son of me, Anayan.

21:54.350 --> 21:56.750
You're my own flesh and blood.

21:59.640 --> 22:01.110
When you sold me for five taels of silver

22:01.110 --> 22:02.350
to the Zhang family,

22:03.960 --> 22:06.290
did it never cross your mind I was your son?

22:08.270 --> 22:10.400
Do you even know what the Zhang family…

22:12.030 --> 22:13.160
bought me for?

22:18.350 --> 22:19.350
I do know.

22:20.330 --> 22:23.620
You look exactly like
the son of the Zhang family.

22:24.240 --> 22:26.880
They bought you to be his body double.

22:28.940 --> 22:32.120
Don't you know the fate of a body double?

22:33.440 --> 22:35.590
Weren't you afraid I'd die in the Zhang family?

22:35.590 --> 22:36.920
But you didn't die.

22:37.560 --> 22:41.210
You even became
the master of the Zhang family.

22:43.330 --> 22:45.910
You don't know how happy I was

22:46.200 --> 22:47.720
when I recognized you.

22:47.920 --> 22:49.120
Everything I have now

22:50.160 --> 22:51.620
has nothing to do with you.

22:53.510 --> 22:54.720
I owe you nothing.

22:56.070 --> 22:59.160
If they find out you're a fake,

22:59.730 --> 23:02.360
can you still be the family master?

23:05.750 --> 23:06.680
I promise you,

23:08.240 --> 23:10.270
as long as you kill Wangquan Hongye

23:10.570 --> 23:14.000
and help me secure my position
as the National Preceptor of the Beast Kingdom,

23:14.000 --> 23:15.310
I'll let you go.

23:15.750 --> 23:16.950
This is the last time.

23:17.000 --> 23:18.070
The last time.

23:26.470 --> 23:29.480
[Clinic]

23:26.590 --> 23:27.120
Huaizhu.

23:27.750 --> 23:28.510
Qinlan?

23:32.590 --> 23:33.520
Why are you here?

23:33.970 --> 23:35.820
Young Master Wangquan sent me.

23:36.030 --> 23:36.980
Is something wrong?

23:36.980 --> 23:39.110
He and Li Quzhuo had something to handle.

23:39.110 --> 23:41.770
He said he couldn't watch
shooting stars with you tonight,

23:41.770 --> 23:43.630
so he asked me to keep you company.

23:44.030 --> 23:45.130
Important matters come first.

23:45.130 --> 23:47.150
Let's go.
Take me to get something delicious.

23:47.150 --> 23:47.820
Okay.

23:49.590 --> 23:50.720
Let's go over there.

23:59.800 --> 24:00.800
Classmate Zhang.

24:04.400 --> 24:06.010
[Lotus Academy]

24:05.820 --> 24:07.290
♪ Has there been a dream ♪

24:06.790 --> 24:08.400
Good morning, Classmate Zhang.

24:07.920 --> 24:11.420
♪ Where you cried and chased after someone's back? ♪

24:10.070 --> 24:11.270
I'm heading in first!

24:12.460 --> 24:16.360
♪ Your face is streaked with tears when you wake up ♪

24:18.360 --> 24:19.270
♪ Memories are like wind ♪

24:19.940 --> 24:21.580
♪ Traveling a long journey ♪

24:21.960 --> 24:23.270
Classmate Zhang.

24:21.960 --> 24:23.910
♪ The sun sets and the moon rises ♪

24:24.560 --> 24:26.310
♪ You're a wavering candle flame ♪

24:24.790 --> 24:28.270
I really don't know
how to draw these tricky talismans.

24:27.070 --> 24:29.960
♪ Shedding light on our past ♪

24:29.130 --> 24:30.570
Please help me.

24:30.770 --> 24:32.310
♪ How do I ♪

24:30.960 --> 24:32.550
You saved me once before.

24:32.750 --> 24:34.400
Just save me one more time, please.

24:32.880 --> 24:34.160
♪ Tell you ♪

24:34.630 --> 24:36.290
♪ I love you? ♪

24:37.030 --> 24:38.540
♪ How do I ♪

24:38.600 --> 24:40.250
Classmate Zhang.

24:38.980 --> 24:40.320
♪ Tell you how much ♪

24:40.400 --> 24:42.050
Please help me.

24:40.860 --> 24:42.900
♪ I miss you? ♪

24:42.720 --> 24:43.920
Please.

24:43.740 --> 24:46.470
♪ A parting is like a tree's growth ring ♪

24:47.170 --> 24:49.680
♪ The rings are trapping ♪

24:50.250 --> 24:55.220
♪ All the lovesick souls ♪

24:56.420 --> 24:58.910
♪ No words are needed when our eyes lock ♪

24:59.610 --> 25:01.910
♪ No words are needed when our souls connect ♪

25:02.520 --> 25:04.930
♪ Turn around, love is like falling petals ♪

25:05.750 --> 25:08.200
♪ How to grow roots? ♪

25:08.960 --> 25:11.770
♪ No words are needed when we brush shoulders ♪

25:12.600 --> 25:15.000
♪ It goes without saying that we yearn for each other ♪

25:15.680 --> 25:18.610
♪ We missed out on each other ♪

25:19.090 --> 25:22.400
♪ We're waiting for a reunion ♪

25:24.080 --> 25:25.810
You've finished drawing them?

25:29.510 --> 25:33.110
Classmate Zhang, why is your face so red?

25:34.510 --> 25:36.000
Is it very hot today?

25:37.740 --> 25:39.280
♪ How do I ♪

25:39.850 --> 25:41.130
♪ Tell you ♪

25:41.600 --> 25:43.260
♪ I love you? ♪

25:44.000 --> 25:45.630
♪ How do I ♪

25:45.950 --> 25:47.690
♪ Tell you how much ♪

25:48.210 --> 25:49.910
♪ I miss you? ♪

25:51.090 --> 25:53.640
♪ A parting is like a tree's growth ring ♪

25:54.520 --> 25:56.680
♪ The rings are trapping ♪

25:57.600 --> 26:02.360
♪ All the lovesick souls ♪

26:00.070 --> 26:01.200
Asparagus wontons.

26:01.400 --> 26:02.330
A reward for you.

26:03.330 --> 26:06.030
♪ No words are needed when our eyes lock ♪

26:06.520 --> 26:09.020
♪ No words are needed when our souls connect ♪

26:07.960 --> 26:09.240
Stop eating that.

26:09.430 --> 26:12.000
♪ Turn around, love is like falling petals ♪

26:09.640 --> 26:10.440
Eat this.

26:12.660 --> 26:15.210
♪ How to grow roots? ♪

26:13.400 --> 26:14.350
Try one.

26:16.250 --> 26:18.980
♪ No words are needed when we brush shoulders ♪

26:19.650 --> 26:22.270
♪ It goes without saying that we yearn for each other ♪

26:22.920 --> 26:26.640
♪ We missed out on each other ♪

26:28.640 --> 26:31.960
♪ We're waiting for a reunion ♪

26:39.590 --> 26:41.310
Where are you going?

26:50.240 --> 26:52.920
See you tomorrow, Classmate Zhang!

26:57.550 --> 26:59.810
Why has he turned into a different person

27:00.160 --> 27:02.090
after becoming the family master?

27:05.680 --> 27:06.270
My Lady.

27:06.550 --> 27:10.480
This is the portrait
of the new National Preceptor that you requested.

27:12.410 --> 27:16.040
[Anayan, National Preceptor of the Beast Kingdom]

27:15.110 --> 27:16.200
It's really her.

27:18.110 --> 27:19.790
Everything makes sense now.

27:22.760 --> 27:24.850
My Lady, what's wrong?

27:25.110 --> 27:25.830
Nothing.

27:26.660 --> 27:29.060
Keep monitoring Zhang Zheng's movements.

27:46.310 --> 27:48.510
Huaizhu, I'm getting a bit sleepy.

27:49.210 --> 27:51.070
Do you still want to eat something?

27:51.070 --> 27:51.640
Yes.

27:52.610 --> 27:53.910
What do you want to eat?

27:54.070 --> 27:54.960
Roast chicken.

27:55.530 --> 27:56.880
All you think about is food.

27:56.880 --> 27:57.440
You little foodie.

27:57.440 --> 27:58.360
Miss Dongfang.

28:03.770 --> 28:04.700
Where's Hongye?

28:06.400 --> 28:08.260
Didn't he go stargazing with you?

28:08.400 --> 28:10.810
Didn't you two go out to handle something?

28:10.920 --> 28:11.850
What do you mean?

28:13.920 --> 28:14.640
Qinlan,

28:15.200 --> 28:16.530
what's really going on?

28:21.080 --> 28:22.150
I...

28:23.750 --> 28:24.830
I just didn't want

28:24.830 --> 28:26.680
him to go stargazing with you.

28:27.920 --> 28:29.980
I didn't expect him to be so stubborn.

28:30.550 --> 28:33.590
If you didn't show up,
he should've just come back.

28:34.830 --> 28:37.070
Oh no, it's much colder at night.

28:37.070 --> 28:38.600
Hongye will get frostbite.

28:39.400 --> 28:40.160
Quzhuo,

28:40.590 --> 28:42.120
please take care of Qinlan.

28:42.240 --> 28:43.810
I'll bring him back safely.

28:44.000 --> 28:45.660
Huaizhu, I'll go with you.

28:55.030 --> 28:55.980
Hongye!

28:58.510 --> 28:59.310
Hongye!

29:04.240 --> 29:05.000
Hongye!

29:06.750 --> 29:07.590
Hongye!

29:11.790 --> 29:12.440
You came.

29:24.040 --> 29:28.270
♪ The soul wandering in destiny ♪

29:29.430 --> 29:31.750
♪ It melts in your ♪

29:32.820 --> 29:35.330
♪ Gentle gaze ♪

29:38.220 --> 29:42.390
♪ I trace your silhouette with my fingertips ♪

29:43.590 --> 29:45.500
♪ Reduced into ashes ♪

29:46.690 --> 29:49.430
♪ I'm still looking for you ♪

29:47.470 --> 29:48.410
Sorry.

29:50.110 --> 29:51.830
♪ I used to be like the wind, searching ♪

29:52.250 --> 29:53.350
♪ Every nook and cranny ♪

29:54.080 --> 29:55.520
♪ And I was once like water, asking ♪

29:54.830 --> 29:55.720
Huaizhu.

29:55.700 --> 29:56.670
♪ Every lake ♪

29:57.170 --> 29:58.810
♪ I swallow the growing thorns ♪

29:57.920 --> 29:59.310
Look at the shooting stars.

29:59.310 --> 30:01.170
♪ Lost in love's bitter toll ♪

30:02.340 --> 30:04.180
♪ Yet I heard the pulse ♪

30:05.110 --> 30:08.200
♪ Letting everything rise from the void ♪

30:09.050 --> 30:11.790
♪ Making the sun and moon vanish from obsession ♪

30:12.770 --> 30:15.130
♪ And love drowns me ♪

30:16.220 --> 30:19.220
♪ In the fatal ecstasy ♪

30:20.080 --> 30:22.700
♪ If I turn into a poisonous thorn apple ♪

30:23.560 --> 30:26.340
♪ Lurking in the dark ♪

30:26.570 --> 30:28.500
Qinlan is too mischievous.

30:26.960 --> 30:28.270
♪ If I can look ♪

30:28.680 --> 30:30.280
I'll have a good talk with her later.

30:29.080 --> 30:31.940
♪ Into your eyes, lingering ♪

30:32.530 --> 30:33.200
It's alright.

30:32.770 --> 30:35.020
♪ And falling ♪

30:35.060 --> 30:36.720
She packed your favorite food

30:36.730 --> 30:37.960
in this meal box.

30:38.820 --> 30:40.550
She put a lot of thought into it.

30:45.280 --> 30:48.190
Besides, I just arrived a little early.

30:48.740 --> 30:52.540
♪ The soul wandering in destiny ♪

30:48.930 --> 30:50.210
I knew you'd come.

30:53.990 --> 30:56.220
♪ It melts in your ♪

30:57.070 --> 30:59.800
♪ Gentle gaze ♪

31:02.680 --> 31:06.750
♪ I trace your silhouette with my fingertips ♪

31:07.890 --> 31:09.730
♪ Reduced into ashes ♪

31:09.110 --> 31:11.640
It's warmer this way.

31:10.570 --> 31:13.820
♪ I'm still looking for you ♪

31:45.540 --> 31:48.600
♪ Letting everything rise from the void ♪

31:49.480 --> 31:52.310
♪ Making the sun and moon vanish from obsession ♪

31:53.200 --> 31:55.630
♪ And love drowns me ♪

31:53.380 --> 31:55.060
So when my heart beats fast,

31:56.400 --> 31:58.810
I can use the demonic aura to stop time.

31:56.640 --> 31:59.870
♪ In the fatal ecstasy ♪

32:00.510 --> 32:03.080
♪ If I turn into a poisonous thorn apple ♪

32:03.110 --> 32:04.110
What's wrong?

32:03.990 --> 32:06.870
♪ Lurking in the dark ♪

32:07.390 --> 32:08.870
♪ If I can look ♪

32:09.490 --> 32:12.370
♪ Into your eyes, lingering ♪

32:13.780 --> 32:16.910
♪ Letting everything rise from the void ♪

32:17.790 --> 32:20.460
♪ Making the sun and moon vanish from obsession ♪

32:21.440 --> 32:23.980
♪ And love drowns me ♪

32:24.790 --> 32:27.970
♪ In the fatal ecstasy ♪

32:28.680 --> 32:31.310
♪ If I turn into a poisonous thorn apple ♪

32:32.110 --> 32:34.930
♪ Lurking in the dark ♪

32:35.440 --> 32:36.650
♪ If I can look ♪

32:37.600 --> 32:40.800
♪ Into your eyes, lingering ♪

32:42.020 --> 32:45.740
♪ And falling ♪

32:50.110 --> 32:51.000
Sorry.

32:52.110 --> 32:54.720
I didn't know the desert nights were so cold.

32:56.000 --> 32:58.440
I didn't mean to hurt you.

32:59.550 --> 33:00.160
I'm sorry.

33:00.590 --> 33:01.240
It's okay.

33:01.920 --> 33:03.440
Can you be more sincere?

33:06.790 --> 33:08.300
Well, how about this?

33:12.790 --> 33:13.790
Three days.

33:14.200 --> 33:16.830
For the next three days,
I won't say a single bad word about you,

33:16.830 --> 33:17.640
nor will I give you a hard time.

33:17.640 --> 33:18.400
Alright.

33:19.400 --> 33:20.090
Thank you.

33:25.850 --> 33:26.550
Well,

33:26.690 --> 33:29.750
the pharmacy owner
has made some cinnamon mutton soup.

33:29.750 --> 33:31.740
He'll be here soon. I'll go greet him.

33:31.740 --> 33:32.830
I'll go with you.

33:32.880 --> 33:33.590
Quzhuo.

33:34.170 --> 33:35.480
Stay with Hongye.

33:35.610 --> 33:36.930
I'll go with Qinlan.

33:41.510 --> 33:43.610
Hongye, Hongye!

33:44.580 --> 33:46.550
The mutton soup, the mutton soup!

33:46.600 --> 33:47.550
I got it.

33:47.670 --> 33:48.810
You can have the bones.

33:48.810 --> 33:50.570
You understand me best.

33:50.940 --> 33:52.000
By the way, Hongye,

33:52.590 --> 33:54.750
to prevent this from happening again,

33:56.110 --> 33:57.910
I put an eavesdropping talisman

33:59.030 --> 34:00.290
on Qinlan.

34:01.160 --> 34:02.290
You're ridiculous.

34:05.880 --> 34:08.250
We've found a way
to sneak into the Drunken Dream Tower.

34:08.250 --> 34:10.650
Tomorrow, Hongye and I will go check it out.

34:11.320 --> 34:13.360
You're going out alone with him again?

34:13.360 --> 34:14.960
Do you dislike him that much?

34:17.400 --> 34:18.280
Huaizhu,

34:19.360 --> 34:22.090
don't tell me
you've really had a change of heart.

34:24.000 --> 34:25.400
I haven't.

34:26.230 --> 34:27.830
You'll understand someday.

34:30.230 --> 34:32.630
Anyway, I think the masked sir is better—

34:32.800 --> 34:35.730
1,000 times better than that annoying young master!

34:36.320 --> 34:37.510
Masked sir this,

34:37.510 --> 34:38.710
masked sir that.

34:39.070 --> 34:40.110
She's blind!

34:40.960 --> 34:41.710
Hongye,

34:42.150 --> 34:43.550
how about I rush out right now

34:43.550 --> 34:44.840
and tell Qinlan

34:44.960 --> 34:46.400
that you're the Mask Group Leader?

34:46.400 --> 34:47.110
No.

34:47.920 --> 34:51.320
The Mask Group
is considered heretical in the Yiqi Alliance.

34:52.960 --> 34:54.590
So, do you plan…

34:56.760 --> 34:58.290
to win her over with virtue?

34:59.110 --> 35:01.760
I just don't like that annoying young master!

35:10.280 --> 35:11.670
Actually,

35:12.630 --> 35:14.000
he's not a bad guy.

35:14.800 --> 35:16.000
Kinda interesting.

35:16.190 --> 35:17.920
What's interesting about him?

35:18.320 --> 35:21.280
He has a bad temper

35:21.320 --> 35:22.760
and is moody.

35:22.920 --> 35:24.030
He's just

35:24.550 --> 35:28.210
smooth and calm
in handling matters and not fussing over trifles.

35:29.260 --> 35:30.880
But he's also ruthless

35:30.880 --> 35:32.070
and cold-blooded.

35:32.670 --> 35:35.320
He's just ruling
with both kindness and authority.

35:35.320 --> 35:37.720
He's cold on the outside but warm-hearted.

35:40.230 --> 35:41.440
Huaizhu,

35:42.710 --> 35:45.640
are we talking about the same Young Master Wangquan?

35:46.000 --> 35:46.920
I think so.

35:49.400 --> 35:50.390
You're serious?

35:50.670 --> 35:51.510
Yes.

35:54.440 --> 35:56.800
Then is the Mask Group Leader your first love

35:56.800 --> 35:57.920
or your true love?

35:58.780 --> 36:01.860
If my first love is my true love,

36:02.110 --> 36:03.440
wouldn't it be perfect?

36:05.000 --> 36:05.960
Huaizhu,

36:06.150 --> 36:08.630
you're basically two-timing now.

36:09.550 --> 36:10.840
My silly sister,

36:11.000 --> 36:11.920
if you don't go get the soup soon,

36:11.920 --> 36:12.800
it'll get cold.

36:13.190 --> 36:14.510
Let it get cold.

36:14.630 --> 36:16.430
I'll make sure he drinks it cold.

36:28.880 --> 36:30.110
I can smell the mutton soup.

36:30.110 --> 36:31.310
They'll be here soon.

36:33.960 --> 36:34.840
So,

36:36.860 --> 36:37.990
I'm that great, huh?

36:41.920 --> 36:44.190
Tone it down. You're grinning ear to ear.

36:47.880 --> 36:49.010
I'll go get the soup.

37:08.080 --> 37:15.150
[Drunken Dream Tower]

38:37.920 --> 38:38.710
Master.

38:39.800 --> 38:40.710
Master.

38:44.610 --> 38:45.670
-Master.
-Master.

38:47.070 --> 38:48.000
Master, look.

38:48.590 --> 38:49.550
For that flower,

38:49.570 --> 38:51.520
we've lost a lot of our people.

38:51.800 --> 38:53.330
Then start the Demon Fight.

38:53.670 --> 38:55.470
Bring in new blood from outside.

38:56.070 --> 38:57.070
No matter what,

38:57.550 --> 38:59.010
I must get the Twilight Mist Flower.

38:59.010 --> 39:00.100
Yes, Master.

39:00.840 --> 39:03.490
I told you to find Wangquan Hongye.

39:03.630 --> 39:05.550
Why is there still no news?
